CLASS com/xk72/proxy/ssl/class_1378 com/xk72/proxy/ssl/MaybeSSLClientConnection
	COMMENT [inferred] the connection back to the client once Charles has taken over the TLS session:
	COMMENT it wraps the existing connection's socket in a server-mode SSLSocket serving the
	COMMENT certificate SSLContextFactory forged, and delegates every other Connection method to the
	COMMENT connection it wrapped. HttpProxyHandler tests for this type to decide whether a request
	COMMENT is HTTPS. The counterpart of SSLRemoteConnection; Charles 4 left the class unnamed, so
	COMMENT "client" here is a reading of which side it faces, not a recovered word.
